Charges -->\r\n<section id=\"why\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"grid\">\r\n<div class=\"col-6\">\r\n<h2><b>Why Choose Atlas Aircon</b></h2>\r\n<p class=\"lead\">Count on our <b>expert AC repair in Vadodara</b> for fast restoration, <b>fair charges</b>, and real peace of mind.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Experience you can feel:</b> Serving Vadodara for <b>12+ years</b> with thousands of successful repairs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Certified technicians:</b> Avg. <b>8 years’</b> hands‑on experience across residential, commercial, and industrial AC.</li>\r\n<li><b>30‑Day Service Guarantee:</b> If the same issue returns within 30 days, we’ll make it right.</li>\r\n<li><b>Transparent Pricing Promise:</b> <i>No hidden costs.</i> <b>Final price quoted</b> before work begins.</li>\r\n<li><b>All brands &amp; types:</b> Split, Window, Cassette, Ductable, VRF/VRV, Chiller, Inverter, and more.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Jump to: <a href=\"#services\"><b>Services</b></a> • <a href=\"#prices\"><b>Charges</b></a> • <a href=\"#areas\"><b>Areas</b></a> • <a href=\"#faq\"><b>FAQ</b></a> • <a href=\"#contact\"><b>Contact</b></a></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"prices\" class=\"col-6\">\r\n<h3><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://atlasaircons.com/affordable-and-expert-ac-repair-service/\"><b>AC Repair Charges — Clear &amp; Honest</b></a></h3>\r\n<table aria-label=\"AC Repair Charges\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Service</th>\r\n<th>Typical Charges</th>\r\n<th>Notes</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><b>Inspection / Visit</b></td>\r\n<td class=\"price\"><b>₹299</b></td>\r\n<td>Waived if repair approved</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><b>Standard Service</b></td>\r\n<td class=\"price\"><b>₹499</b></td>\r\n<td>Cleaning, basic tune‑up</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><b>Gas Refilling</b></td>\r\n<td class=\"price\"><b>From ₹1800</b></td>\r\n<td>R32/R410A/R22 as applicable</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><b>Installation / Uninstallation</b></td>\r\n<td class=\"price\"